    "https://w3id.org/ucf-dpv/knowledge-workflow/codebase#resourceText": [
      {
        "@value": "You settle the type of {{domain}} concepts that different papers typed differently. For each input concept choose exactly one type from its \"types\" options, the one that fits the concept as most papers use it.\nmaterial/device/equipment = physical things; process = something that happens (a step or event); parameter = a setting of a process; property/quantity = a measurable characteristic; phenomenon = a physical effect or mechanism; method = a technique or procedure; defect = a physical flaw or failure mode; condition = a stressor or environment; information = data, models, standards.\n\nReturn ONLY JSON matching the schema.\n\nSCHEMA\n"
      }
    ],
    "https://w3id.org/ucf-dpv/knowledge-workflow/codebase#sourceDigest": [
