  {
    "@id": "https://w3id.org/ucf-dpv/knowledge-workflow/codebase#function/src/agents/enrichment.py:EnrichmentAgent._candidates",
    "@type": [
      "https://w3id.org/ucf-dpv/knowledge-workflow/codebase#CodeUnitSpecification",
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@value": "Mapping candidates per class:\n1. the ontology store, over every ontology in it: label, synonyms and lexical head (exact and trigram)\n   and the class's embedding (label + first source definition);\n2. the MDS-Onto portal and MatPortal searches over every ontology each portal hosts, with cleaned\n   queries (exact label, full label, general term, spelled-out synonym of an abbreviation); a hit for a\n   term in the store (also under another IRI of the same ontology, matched by label) joins the pool with\n   the store's record, flagged with the portal(s) that found it; a hit outside the store (public IRI only)\n   is a candidate too, scored on its label, up to portal_per_class per class;\n3. ranked label matches first, then score: the store's best candidates_per_class, then the portal-only\n   ones; then terms one and two mapping hops away from a label-matched or strong store candidate, with\n   confidence decaying per hop and the path recorded."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@value": "src/agents/enrichment.py:EnrichmentAgent._candidates"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Combine store candidates, bounded portal searches and propagated mappings, preserving source, score, path and label-match distinctions."
      }
    ],
