        "@value": "Merge section answers into one paper graph. Relation/causal/measurement ends are resolved by concept id,\nor - since small models often write the phrase instead of the id - by label or synonym, by the longest known\nconcept named inside the phrase, or (short phrases only) as a new concept taken from the text."
      }
