      {
        "@value": "You write the summary section of a corpus report for a set of {{domain}} research papers. The input gives the highest-ranked concepts (with importance tier, paper count and mention count), the best-supported causal claims, and the longest causal chains.\n\nReturn ONLY JSON:\n- summary: 2 short paragraphs on what the corpus is about, which concepts dominate, and which causal mechanisms recur. Use only the input. No claims beyond it.\n- themes: 3-7 thematic groups, each with a short name and the input concept labels that belong to it.\n\nSCHEMA\n"
      }
    ],
