        "@value": "You find supporting quotes in ONE SECTION of a {{domain}} research paper. Each item in CLAIMS was extracted from this section but has no quote. For each claim id, copy the sentence fragment from SECTION that states it: verbatim, at most 20 words, quantities and qualifiers unchanged. If the section does not state the claim, return an empty string for it. Never paraphrase and never invent text.\n\nReturn ONLY JSON matching the schema, with one entry per claim id.\n\nSCHEMA\n"
